    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31996" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκθει-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make a god of, deify,</i>
